@baseUrl = https://localhost:9443/dashboard
@apiKey = replace-with-host-api-key
@expectedVersion = 1
@idempotencyKey = replace-with-unique-operation-id

### Preview the complete desired configuration. Replace the revision and lists before use.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/config/changes/preview
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expectedVersion": {{expectedVersion}},
  "routes": [{"routeId":"example","clusterId":"example","match":{"path":"/example/{**catch-all}"}}],
  "clusters": [{"clusterId":"example","destinations":{"one":{"address":"http://localhost:8080/"}}}]
}

### Apply once. Repeat this identical request and key after an uncertain response.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/config/changes
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expectedVersion": {{expectedVersion}},
  "routes": [{"routeId":"example","clusterId":"example","match":{"path":"/example/{**catch-all}"}}],
  "clusters": [{"clusterId":"example","destinations":{"one":{"address":"http://localhost:8080/"}}}]
}

### Inspect a plugin candidate without activating it.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/plugins/preview
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"enabledPluginIds":["compression"]}
